            "title": "Expect a photo op and a 'mock deal' at the Trump-Xi meeting — ...",
            "snippets": [
              "Expect a photo opportunity, a \"mock deal\" — and temporary market relief from the much-touted meeting between U.S. President Donald Trump and his Chinese counterpart Xi Jinping at the G-20 meeting, an economist told CNBC.\nBusiness\nTech\nVideo\nPRO",
              "# Expect a photo op and a 'mock deal' at the Trump-Xi meeting — not a long-term truce, says economist\n- There will be temporary market relief from the much-touted meeting between U.S. President Donald Trump and his Chinese counterpart Xi Jinping at the G-20 in Buenos Aires, Argentina, said Bo Zhuang, chief economist and director of China research at TS Lombard.\n- However, trade tension will continue to escalate",
              "Expect a photo opportunity, a \"mock deal,\" and temporary market relief from the much-touted meeting between U.S. President and his Chinese counterpart at the , an economist said on Friday.\n\n\"We don't think this deal will be engineering a long-term truce between the two countries,\" Bo Zhuang, chief economist and director of China research at TS Lombard, said of the meeting in Buenos Aires, Argentina next week",
              "Zhuang told CNBC he expected a \"photo op\" and a probable \"mock deal\" from the meeting between the leaders of the world's two largest economies, \"which means there will be temporary market-positive feedback from that.\"\n\nBut trade tensions will continue to escalate, he added",
              "{\"headline\":\"Expect a photo op and a 'mock deal' at the Trump-Xi meeting — not a long-term truce, says economist\",\"dateCreated\":\"2018-11-23T07:38:44+0000\",\"datePublished\":\"2018-11-23T07:38:44+0000\",\"dateModified\":\"2018-11-23T09:59:04+0000\",\"author\":[{\"name\":\"Huileng Tan\"}],\"publisher\":{\"name\":\"CNBC\",\"foundingDate\":\"1989-04-17\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/cnbc\",\"https://www.instagram.com/cnbc\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/cnbc\",\"https://twitter.com/cnbc\",\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CNBC\",\"https://www.youtube.com/cnbc\"]},\"articleSection\":\"Business News\",\"keywords\":[\"cnbc\",\"Articles\",\"US Dollar/Chinese Renminbi FX Spot Rate\",\"Politics\",\"Economy\",\"Trade\",\"World economy\",\"Beijing\",\"United States\",\"Business\",\"China\",\"Asia News\",\"Asia Economy\",\"Markets\",\"Business News\",\"China Economy\",\"World Economy\",\"source:tagname:CNBC Asia Source\"]}"
            ]
